id: CTB-SRC0025-dec011
source: SRC-0025
section: §0.2
kind: requirement
extends: LXM-REQ-000048
decision: LXM-DEC-000011
text: By owner decision LXM-DEC-000011, the full test-suite floor is raised to Node 22.22.2 or later and the development tooling is re-resolved to its fixed versions; the production floor stays 22.13.0 with a runtime-only lane, and host installs get a security floor declared in the technology lock.
